# Corpus pipeline — all intermediate and raw artifacts ignored.
# Final outputs will be explicitly committed after the pipeline completes
# and all gates pass verification.
# Anchored to repo root so it doesn't ignore source dirs like
# kask/mcp-servers/hkask-mcp-corpus/src/corpus/.
/corpus/
